  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF in Northern Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF program support in northern provinces of Mozambique targetting communities and group of individuals affected by attacks and insurgency. One of the outputs of the program is to ensure access to safe, inclusive, and enabling learning environment, by equipting learning spaces with gender-segregated WASH facilities and distribute essential learning supplies (school-in-a-box, school and individual hygiene kits including COVID-19 personal protective equipment, Menstrual Hygiene Management kits, and assistive devices for children with disability).</narrative>
  </description>
